  "description": "The meme targets a broad audience familiar with internet humor, particularly those who recognize and enjoy exaggerated animal sound memes. The format relies on understanding meme conventions, such as stretching out sounds for comedic effect (e.g., 'Goooooooooooooon!!!!') and pairing it with expressive animal imagery (a dog howling in a snowy landscape). This appeals to users of social media platforms where such memes are commonly shared and appreciated.",
